[
  {
    "id": "elem_1",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "---",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_2",
    "type": "heading1",
    "content": "## 摘要",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_3",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "随着人工智能技术的发展，强化学习（Reinforcement Learning，RL）在机器人控制、自动驾驶、资源调度以及大语言模型（Large Language Models, LLMs）等领域得到了广泛应用。传统的任务调度方法通常依赖于人工设计规则，在面对动态变化的复杂环境时难以获得最优性能。本文提出一种基于深度强化学习（Deep Reinforcement Learning, DRL）的智能任务调度框架，将调度问题建模为马尔可夫决策过程（Markov Decision Process, MDP），利用深度神经网络逼近状态价值函数，实现动态决策优化。实验结果表明，相较于传统启发式算法，本文方法在任务完成时间、资源利用率以及系统吞吐量方面均取得了明显提升。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_4",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "**关键词：** 强化学习；深度强化学习；任务调度；智能决策；资源优化",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_5",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "---",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_6",
    "type": "heading1",
    "content": "# 1 引言",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_7",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "近年来，随着云计算、边缘计算以及人工智能应用的快速发展，大规模任务调度问题逐渐成为研究热点。传统调度算法如最短作业优先（SJF）、轮询调度（Round Robin）以及遗传算法（GA）等虽然具有一定效果，但普遍存在适应能力不足的问题。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_8",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "强化学习能够通过智能体（Agent）与环境（Environment）的不断交互学习最优策略，而无需依赖大量人工规则，因此特别适合求解动态优化问题。近年来，Deep Q Network（DQN）、Proximal Policy Optimization（PPO）以及Soft Actor-Critic（SAC）等算法不断推动强化学习的发展，使其能够解决高维状态空间中的复杂决策任务。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_9",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "本文针对动态任务调度问题，设计了一种基于PPO算法的强化学习调度模型，实现任务执行效率与资源利用率的协同优化。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_10",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "---",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_11",
    "type": "heading1",
    "content": "# 2 相关工作",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_12",
    "type": "heading2",
    "content": "## 2.1 强化学习基础",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_13",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "强化学习由智能体、环境、状态、动作以及奖励组成。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_14",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "在时刻 $t$：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "在时刻 ",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "：",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_15",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- 状态：$s_t$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "状态：",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>s</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_16",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- 动作：$a_t$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "动作：",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>a</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_17",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- 奖励：$r_t$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "奖励：",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_18",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "智能体根据策略",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_20",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "\\pi(a|s)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>π(a|s)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_22",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "选择动作，并不断最大化累计奖励",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_24",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "R_t=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\gamma^k r_{t+k}",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>R</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>=</m:t></m:r><m:nary><m:naryPr><m:chr m:val=\"∑\"/><m:limLoc m:val=\"subSup\"/><m:grow m:val=\"1\"/><m:subHide m:val=\"off\"/><m:supHide m:val=\"off\"/></m:naryPr><m:sub><m:r><m:t>k=0</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:r><m:t>∞</m:t></m:r></m:sup><m:e><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>γ</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup></m:e></m:nary><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t+k</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_26",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其中：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_27",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- $\\gamma$ 为折扣因子；",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>γ</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": " 为折扣因子；",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_28",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- $0<\\gamma<1$。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>0&lt;γ&lt;1</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "。",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_29",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "---",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_30",
    "type": "heading2",
    "content": "## 2.2 深度强化学习",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_31",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "传统Q-Learning使用Q表记录状态价值：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_33",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "Q(s,a)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_35",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "当状态空间较大时无法存储，因此DQN采用神经网络逼近：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_37",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "Q(s,a;\\theta)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>Q(s,a;θ)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_39",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "损失函数定义为：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_41",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "L(\\theta)=\n(r+\\gamma \\max_{a'}Q(s',a';\\theta^-)-Q(s,a;\\theta))^2",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>L(θ)=</m:t></m:r><m:sSup><m:e><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>+</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>γ</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>max</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>a</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>′</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>Q</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>s</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>′</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup><m:r><m:t>,</m:t></m:r><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>a</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>′</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup><m:r><m:t>;</m:t></m:r><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>−</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>−</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>Q</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>s</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>,</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>a</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>;</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>2</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_44",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其中：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_45",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- $\\theta$ 为在线网络参数；",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": " 为在线网络参数；",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_46",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "- $\\theta^-$ 为目标网络参数。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:t>−</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": " 为目标网络参数。",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_47",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "---",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_48",
    "type": "heading2",
    "content": "## 2.3 PPO算法",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_49",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "PPO属于策略梯度方法，通过限制策略更新幅度保证训练稳定。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_50",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其目标函数：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_52",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "L^{clip}(\\theta)=\nE[\n\\min(\nr_t(\\theta)A_t,\nclip(r_t(\\theta),1-\\epsilon,1+\\epsilon)A_t\n)]",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>L</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sup><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>clip</m:t></m:r></m:sup></m:sSup><m:r><m:t>(θ)=𝔼</m:t></m:r><m:d><m:dPr><m:begChr m:val=\"[\"/><m:sepChr m:val=\"m\"/><m:endChr m:val=\"]\"/></m:dPr><m:e/><m:e><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>A</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>,</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>clip</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>,</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>1</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>−</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>ϵ</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>,</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>1</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>+</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>ϵ</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>A</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:e></m:d></m:e></m:d></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_59",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其中",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_61",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "r_t(\\theta)=\n\\frac{\\pi_\\theta(a|s)}\n{\\pi_{\\theta_{old}}(a|s)}",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "is_heading": false,
      "heading_level": 0
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>r</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(θ)=</m:t></m:r><m:f><m:fPr><m:type m:val=\"bar\"/></m:fPr><m:num><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>π</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(a|s)</m:t></m:r></m:num><m:den><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>π</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>θ</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>old</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(a|s)</m:t></m:r></m:den></m:f></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
